# Line endings (v1.21): every checkout has LF, also on Windows, where Git for Windows
# sets core.autocrlf=true by default. With CRLF files the build is not reproducible
# (the executable differs from the one of the Release) and TestPinnedToolchain cannot
# read go.mod. Go, PowerShell and Windows Terminal all read LF files.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never converted.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.7z binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.syso binary
